== Third-party Content

Bosch certificates (src/main/resources/cert)
* bosch-device-root-ca.pem: root of the device certificates of the cameras, as published by Robert Bosch Smart Home GmbH
  with the documentation of the local camera API
* bosch-st-root-ca.pem and bosch-video-ca-2a.pem: root and intermediate certificate of the Bosch cloud the cameras are
  managed through, as presented by it
* Used only to verify TLS connections; public certificates, no keys
* Documentation: https://github.com/BoschSmartHome/bosch-camera-api-docs
